Starter --> GameEngine
GameEngine --> GameState
GameEngine --> CommandParser
GameEngine --> EventBus
GameState *-- Player
GameState *-- World
GameState *-- QuestJournal
GameState *-- AchievementTracker
GameState *-- GameClock
GameState *-- CommandHistory
QuestJournal o-- "0..*" Quest
Quest --> QuestStatus
AchievementTracker o-- "0..*" Achievement
GameClock --> WeatherPhase
WorldMap ..> GameState : besuchte Räume
DialogueService o-- "0..*" Character
Character <|.. Mara
Character <|.. MarketTrader
Character <|.. StoneGuardian
TalkCommand --> DialogueService
GameState --> RoomId
WorldFactory ..> World : erstellt
World *-- "12" Room
Room --> RoomId
Room --> Direction
Room o-- "0..*" Item
Player *-- Inventory
Inventory o-- "0..*" Item
Item <|-- KeyItem
Item <|-- LanternItem
Item <|-- PrismItem
Item <|-- HerbItem
Command <|.. MoveCommand
Command <|.. TakeCommand
Command <|.. UseCommand
Command <|.. TalkCommand
Command <|.. LookCommand
Command <|.. InspectCommand
Command <|.. HelpCommand
Command <|.. InventoryCommand
Command <|.. MapCommand
Command <|.. SaveCommand
Command <|.. LoadCommand
Command <|.. QuitCommand
Command <|.. UnknownCommand
Command <|.. JournalCommand
Command <|.. AchievementsCommand
Command <|.. TimeCommand
Command <|.. HistoryCommand
CommandParser ..> Command : erzeugt
CommandParser --> InputValidator
Command ..> GameState : verändert / liest
SaveRepository <|.. PropertiesSaveRepository
SaveCommand ..> SaveRepository
LoadCommand ..> SaveRepository
EventBus o-- "0..*" GameEventListener
GameEventListener <|.. ConsoleNarrator
EventBus ..> GameEvent
@enduml
